WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Then think for three or four sentences and give

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.800
that to Quickler as a voice note.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.740
And that is so efficient that we're maybe only

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:12.060
spending a fifth, if not a sixth of the

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:13.380
time actually doing the task.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.200
We spend the rest of the remaining time

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.980
interacting with people, which is what we're there to

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:18.210
do.

